Type: project
Package: bvarusa
Title: A Large Bayesian VAR of the US Economy with Scenarios
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Replication of Crump, Eusepi, Giannone, Qian and Sbordone (2021),
    "A Large Bayesian VAR of the United States Economy" (FRBNY Staff Report 976),
    with a conditional-forecast scenario engine and a Shiny site. This file only
    declares dependencies for renv (explicit snapshot); the project is not an R package.
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports:
    BVAR,
    coda,
    jsonlite,
    fredr,
    targets,
    yaml,
    readxl,
    quantmod,
    scoringRules,
    shiny,
    plotly,
    bslib,
    quarto
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
